<title>USA: Des Moines ACC, Iowa, $1.775 won by Bernardi Sec..</title>
<headline>Des Moines ACC, Iowa, $1.775 won by Bernardi Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Sec. said it won $1.775 million of Des Moines Area Community College, Iowa, Taxable new jobs training certificates, with a net interest cost of 6.61 percent.</p>
</text>
